At run time the plugin uses the @deepseek-ai/* packages of the DeepSeek Harness install it runs
in; they are not bundled. It has no other dependencies.

The dictionaries translate the Bot team's English strings (apps/bots-dsh of this repository,
under the same Apache License, Version 2.0): its client registers the English text as the keys
of the omni-ui namespace, and this pack ships their Brazilian Portuguese.
